  description: '"Clock Wyvern" + 1+ Link Monsters

    When this card is Fusion
    Summoned: You can send cards from the top of your Deck to the GY, equal to the
    total Link Rating of the materials used for this card''s Fusion Summon, and if
    you do, until the end of the next turn, other monsters you control cannot attack,
    also this card gains 1000 ATK for each card sent to the GY by this effect. While
    you control a Link Monster(s), your opponent''s monsters cannot target other
    monsters you control for attacks, also your opponent cannot target other monsters
    you control with card effects. If this Fusion Summoned card you control is sent
    to your GY by an opponent''s card effect: You can add 1 Spell from your Deck
    to your hand.'
